Debugger: game.speed.get and game.speed.set, backported from upstream 44b832f755.

Stock 1.20.4 only fast-forwards from a host key binding, which a script-driven session cannot press.
The handlers set the core parameters directly, as 1.20.4 debugger handlers do.

